Scope of the image's org.opencontainers.image.licenses label
------------------------------------------------------------
The label is "BSD-3-Clause AND MIT" and is deliberately scoped to the
software this project builds and authors: Unbound (BSD-3-Clause) and this
repository's files (MIT). It is NOT a complete statement of every licence in
the image: the redistributed Debian packages listed below carry their own
licences, several of which have no SPDX identifier, so no honest complete
SPDX expression exists. This NOTICE is the per-component list; the
authoritative texts are in the image:

  /usr/share/doc/unbound/LICENSE        Unbound
  /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright    every Debian package recorded in
                                        /var/lib/dpkg/status.d

tests/structure.sh fails the release if any of these files is missing.

Redistributed components (resolver image)
-----------------------------------------
Licences below are as stated in each Debian copyright file ("Files: *"
stanza first). Those files describe the whole source package; stanzas for
build scripts, tests and documentation do not apply to the shipped library,
and some packages list further per-file licences — the file is authoritative.

Built from source:
  Unbound              BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2007, NLnet Labs
                       (https://nlnetlabs.nl/projects/unbound/)

Debian 13 shared libraries that Unbound links, copied from the build stage
(the set is what `ldd` resolves at build time; at the time of writing):
  libc6                LGPL-2.1+; parts under LGPL-2+, LGPL-2.1+ and GPL-2+
                       with link exceptions, BSD-2/3-clause variants, ISC,
                       Inner-Net, SunPro, Unicode-DFS-2016, public domain and
                       others (39 stanzas in its copyright file)
  libssl3t64           Apache-2.0 (OpenSSL 3)
  libevent-2.1-7t64    BSD-3-clause; a few files BSD-2-clause / Expat
  libexpat1            MIT
  libhiredis1.1.0      BSD-3-Clause
  libnghttp2-14        Expat (MIT)
  libprotobuf-c1       BSD-2-Clause (used by dnstap)
  zlib1g               Zlib
  libzstd1             BSD-3-clause or GPL-2 (dual); bundled parts Expat, zlib

From the distroless base image (gcr.io/distroless/base-debian13):
  base-files           GPL-2+ (bundled licence texts: verbatim copying only)
  ca-certificates      MPL-2.0 for the Mozilla CA data; GPL-2+ for Debian's
                       packaging and scripts
  media-types          "ad-hoc": public information, public domain
  netbase              GPL-2
  tzdata               public domain (IANA time zone database)
  tzdata-legacy        public domain (IANA time zone database)
  (plus the base's own copies of some libraries above, replaced at build by
  the harvested ones together with their copyright files)

DNS root data fetched at build time: the root hints published by
InterNIC/IANA, and the DNSSEC root trust anchor obtained by unbound-anchor
from IANA.

Update sidecar image (updater/)
-------------------------------
Redistributes Alpine Linux packages (licences recorded per package in
/lib/apk/db/installed) and the cosign binary from the Sigstore project
(Apache-2.0).
